{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGCht4W97TuUSbPLSyl9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking to rebuild the status bar components and repair frames using fresh node lookups by name, avoiding the stale node id 2007:151 that fails at line 62, since a rollback likely invalidated a stored component. Both parts are independent: I repair the status comps and frames in one call (keeping the existing button comps 2006:25 and tab comps 2006:47, 2006:66 from the successful earlier call), and build 04_Home, 05_My_Asset_Overlay, 06_Notification, 07_Profile, 08_Contact_Info, 09_Bank_Account_Info at x 100, 614, 1128, 1642, 2156, 2670 with y=1200, drawing each status bar inline instead of depending on a component. I run both in parallel, then prototype links, then take screenshots.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5766,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":70483,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5766}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e88086fc-1add-4fb7-8fa0-ba5b7cccc2de","uuid":"263975d1-1333-4ddd-8be1-ba254f77d11f","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:51:34.313Z","thinking_duration_ms":14667}
