{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGDDghd17yWW6WzBFdfs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for verification that the private plan and parallel calls are set up correctly. I check the four back-button targets: the frames 03_Empty, 03_Filled and 03_Error have no \"Icon Button\" back, since the back arrow sits directly via icon() at 30,62 rather than inside a button frame. So those three frames need back hotspots, and 03_Error has no links at all. The contact avatar initials at y=34 are overlapped by the badge at 82,82 inside a 120 frame, so I set the initials to 26px in a 104-wide text aligned center with y=32 and move the badge to x=84, y=84 at size 26 with a white ring. The splash logo plate already looks right on dark. The 04_Home copy reads \"Welcome,\" and \"Jonas.\" across two texts, so I merge them into one \"Welcome, Jonas.\" node in Inter SemiBold 15. The 07_Profile title \"Profile\" and the 09 masked number \"0182128xxx\" stay as they are. I make the single fix call, then take the home and profile verification screenshots once the fix lands.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2623,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":121159,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2623}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e88086fc-1add-4fb7-8fa0-ba5b7cccc2de","uuid":"6fa18bd4-eab7-4656-8ba8-b4b06695efc7","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:58:03.298Z","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":16428}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGDDghd17yWW6WzBFdfs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan for this step: add the missing back hotspots on the three Create Account frames (their arrow is a bare icon, so it has no reaction target), point the Error frame's back link, tighten the Contact avatar badge so it stops covering the initials, and restore the exact \"Welcome, Jonas.\" greeting as one text node. All of that is one edit pass."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2623,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":121159,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2623}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e88086fc-1add-4fb7-8fa0-ba5b7cccc2de","uuid":"72e0602e-cf96-4f96-ab4c-c77e88ae50f2","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:58:05.377Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGDDghd17yWW6WzBFdfs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01W7ce8rkmIf2zhncf5J6tEi","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.indexOf('03 · Workspace')===0);\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst F={fm:{family:'Inter',style:'Medium'},fs:{family:'Inter',style:'Semi Bold'},ds:{family:'DM Sans',style:'SemiBold'}};\nfor(const k in F) await figma.loadFontAsync(F[k]);\nconst rgb=h=>({r:parseInt(h.slice(1,3),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(3,5),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(5,7),16)/255});\nconst solid=(h,op)=>({type:'SOLID',color:rgb(h),opacity:op===undefined?1:op});\nconst find=n=>ws.children.find(c=>c.name===n)||null;\nconst out=[];\n// 1. back hotspots on create-account frames\nconst welcome=find('02_Welcome');\nfor(const nm of ['03_Create_Account_Empty','03_Create_Account_Filled','03_Create_Account_Error']){\n  const f=find(nm); if(!f){out.push(nm+': missing');continue;}\n  let h=f.children.find(c=>c.name==='Hotspot · Back');\n  if(!h){ h=figma.createRectangle(); h.name='Hotspot · Back'; h.resize(48,48); h.fills=[solid('#FFFFFF',0.001)]; f.appendChild(h); h.x=16; h.y=54; }\n  try{ h.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',navigation:'NAVIGATE',destinationId:welcome.id,transition:{type:'DISSOLVE',duration:0.25,easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'}}}]}]; out.push(nm+' back: ok'); }\n  catch(e){ out.push(nm+' back: '+e.message.slice(0,80)); }\n}\n// 2. contact avatar badge + initials\nconst ci=find('08_Contact_Info');\nif(ci){\n  const av=ci.children.find(c=>c.name==='Avatar Block');\n  if(av){\n    const t=av.children.find(c=>c.name==='Avatar Initials'); if(t){t.y=30; t.fontSize=30;}\n    const badge=av.children.find(c=>c.name==='Edit Badge');\n    if(badge){ badge.resize(28,28); badge.cornerRadius=14; badge.x=88; badge.y=88; badge.strokes=[solid('#FFFFFF')]; badge.strokeWeight=3; badge.strokeAlign='OUTSIDE';\n      const disc=badge.children.find(c=>c.name==='Badge Disc'); if(disc){disc.resize(28,28);disc.cornerRadius=14;}\n      const ic=badge.children.find(c=>c.name==='Icon'); if(ic){ ic.x=7; ic.y=7; }\n    }\n    out.push('contact avatar adjusted');\n  }\n}\n// 3. home greeting single node\nconst home=find('04_Home');\nif(home){\n  const hp=home.children.find(c=>c.name==='Header');\n  if(hp){\n    for(const ch of [...hp.children]) if(ch.name==='Greeting'||ch.name==='Greeting Name') ch.remove();\n    const t=figma.createText(); t.name='Greeting'; t.fontName=F.ds; t.fontSize=16; t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:22};\n    t.characters='Welcome, Jonas.'; t.fills=[solid('#12211A')]; hp.appendChild(t); t.x=124; t.y=26;\n    out.push('greeting merged');\n  }\n}\nreturn JSON.stringify(out);","description":"Add back hotspots to signup frames, fix contact avatar badge, merge home greeting copy","fileKey":"vSafL7D98KysOBBo6XqgNW"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2623,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":121159,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2623}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e88086fc-1add-4fb7-8fa0-ba5b7cccc2de","uuid":"b9b21604-a43f-4c14-8162-6e359a1a6827","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:58:13.034Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01W7ce8rkmIf2zhncf5J6tEi","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
