{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGDN8jXGH2Y7e7vOWXv1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the layout of 11 frames and a set of component masters. I check the overview: frame 03_Create_Account_Empty sits at x=1128, y=100, and its disabled \"Create account\" button is near the bottom, which is fine. The component masters at x=1180, y=0 and x=1610, y=0 float above frame 3 and visually collide with frames 3 and 4. I find a real collision: 03_Create_Account_Filled at x=1642 lies under 04_Home at x=1642, and 03_Create_Account_Error at x=2156 lies under 05 at x=2156. The fix is one row at y=100 with x = 100 + i*514: 100, 614, 1128, 1642, 2156, 2670, 3184, 3698, 4212, 4726, 5240. I move the components to y=1120. The overview height is 1064. Reposition first, then screenshot.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2915,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":130917,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2915}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e88086fc-1add-4fb7-8fa0-ba5b7cccc2de","uuid":"19b63558-7494-40a7-88ae-864b9da1f16a","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:59:57.229Z","thinking_duration_ms":14965}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGDN8jXGH2Y7e7vOWXv1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list: (1) I found a real layout collision — `04_Home` sits at x=1642 exactly on top of `03_Create_Account_Filled`, and `05_My_Asset_Overlay` sits on `03_Create_Account_Error`, which is why the overview screenshot shows only nine visible columns. (2) The component masters at y=0 overlap the top of the frame row. (3) After repositioning I need a fresh overview screenshot, plus a screenshot of the two previously hidden signup states.\n\nOnly the repositioning blocks the screenshots, so I'll do that first."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2915,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":130917,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2915}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e88086fc-1add-4fb7-8fa0-ba5b7cccc2de","uuid":"1a61ba78-f8d3-4d45-86f1-78e5f763e820","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:00:00.484Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgGDN8jXGH2Y7e7vOWXv1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0195dKif3Ph6LYeYACXl09rJ","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.indexOf('03 · Workspace')===0);\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst order=['01_Splash','02_Welcome','03_Create_Account_Empty','03_Create_Account_Filled','03_Create_Account_Error','04_Home','05_My_Asset_Overlay','06_Notification','07_Profile','08_Contact_Info','09_Bank_Account_Info'];\nconst placed=[];\norder.forEach((name,i)=>{\n  const f=ws.children.find(c=>c.name===name);\n  if(!f){placed.push(name+': missing');return;}\n  f.x=100+i*514; f.y=140;\n  placed.push(name+' @ '+f.x+','+f.y);\n});\n// move component masters into a library row well below the screens\nconst comps=ws.children.filter(c=>c.type==='COMPONENT');\nconst groups={button:[],field:[],tab:[],status:[]};\nfor(const c of comps){\n  if(c.name.indexOf('Button/')===0)groups.button.push(c);\n  else if(c.name.indexOf('Text Field/')===0)groups.field.push(c);\n  else if(c.name.indexOf('Tab Bar/')===0)groups.tab.push(c);\n  else if(c.name.indexOf('Status Bar/')===0)groups.status.push(c);\n}\nconst base=1120;\ngroups.button.forEach((c,i)=>{c.x=100; c.y=base+i*88;});\ngroups.field.forEach((c,i)=>{c.x=520; c.y=base+i*88;});\ngroups.tab.forEach((c,i)=>{c.x=960; c.y=base+i*100;});\ngroups.status.forEach((c,i)=>{c.x=1440; c.y=base+i*60;});\nreturn JSON.stringify({placed, moved:{buttons:groups.button.length,fields:groups.field.length,tabs:groups.tab.length,status:groups.status.length}, total:ws.children.length});","description":"Reposition the eleven screens into a clean row and move component masters to a library area","fileKey":"vSafL7D98KysOBBo6XqgNW"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_token